Error [E0305]: This pattern belongs to a fallible result, not Int
  --> tests/ui/result_handler_non_result.jet:2:11
    |
  2 |     value ? ok -> print("ok") ! error -> print("error")
    |           ^^^^
 Why: Use `== Ok(...)` or `== Err(...)` on `T !E`
 Fix: Check the type of the value being tested
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0305

